`detect_path_context` 检查 prefix 是否匹配模式如 `changeBG "...` 且最后一个 `"` 未闭合：
```rust
fn detect_path_context(prefix: &str) -> Option<(AssetType, &str)> {
    let lower = prefix.to_lowercase();
    // 指令 → 资源类型映射
    let mappings: &[(&str, AssetType)] = &[
        ("changebg ", AssetType::Image),
        ("changescene ", AssetType::Image),
        ("show ", AssetType::Image),
        ("bgm ", AssetType::Audio),
        ("sfx ", AssetType::Audio),
        ("callscript ", AssetType::Script),
        ("cutscene ", AssetType::Video),
    ];

    for (cmd, asset_type) in mappings {
        if lower.starts_with(cmd) {
            let after_cmd = &prefix[cmd.len()..];
            // 检查是否在未闭合的引号内
            if after_cmd.starts_with('"') && after_cmd.matches('"').count() == 1 {
                let path_prefix = &after_cmd[1..];
                return Some((asset_type.clone(), path_prefix));
            }
        }
    }
    None
}
```

`path_completions` 返回过滤后的资源列表：
```rust
fn path_completions(assets: &AssetIndex, asset_type: &AssetType) -> Vec<CompletionItem> {
    assets.completions_for_type(asset_type)
        .into_iter()
        .map(|entry| CompletionItem {
            label: entry.relative_path.clone(),
            kind: Some(CompletionItemKind::FILE),
            ..Default::default()
        })
        .collect()
}
```

需要在 completion.rs 顶部 import `AssetType` 和 `AssetIndex`。

